## Roadmap

- [ ] **Fully offline mode** — Whisper.cpp + local LLM, zero API keys
- [ ] **Linux** support (X11 + Wayland)
- [ ] **Windows** support
- [ ] **iOS** dictation companion (BLE-bridged)
- [ ] More Indic languages — Tamil, Telugu, Bengali, Marathi, Punjabi
- [ ] Voice commands — *"delete that"*, *"next paragraph"*, *"fix the last line"*
- [ ] Per-app polish profiles (Slack ≠ code editor ≠ email)
- [ ] Team-shared learning rules

